sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Tela mobile
  participant Local as SQLite
  participant Sync as ActivityGateway
  participant API as API Gateway/Lambda
  participant DB as Aurora
  participant Cognito as Cognito JWT
  UI->>Local: salva atividade e amostras
  UI->>Sync: envia atividade pendente
  Sync->>API: POST /v1/activities/sync
  API->>Cognito: valida token
  API->>DB: upsert por id + sub do autor
  DB-->>API: synced
  API-->>Sync: status synced
  UI->>API: POST /v1/reports
  API->>DB: salva relato vinculado ao autor
